     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Renal function tests are likely to be ordered for Hahn to evaluate the function of her kidneys because both hypertension and diabetes can cause kidney damage. Kidney function should also be evaluated before starting pharmacological treatment for hypertension."
    }
